# 统一文本行尾：仓库内容一律 LF，避免 Windows/macOS 检出差异导致配对哈希、门禁与 diff 抖动。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须保持 CRLF，否则 cmd 解析 goto/label 可能异常。
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 明确按二进制处理，避免被行尾/编码转换破坏。
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary